    "We define the problem as: \n\n\u1e91 = arg max_{z\u2208C} \u03a3_{w_n\u2208W} P(z|w_n,D) \u00b7 P(w_n|D)\n\nwhere W represents the space of pathways, and we factorize the probability into gene importance scores within pathways and pathway knowledge discrepancy (KD) \u2014 This objective specifies how scKGOT scores candidate signaling explanations by combining pathway likelihoods with gene-level importance and knowledge discrepancy.": [
